="58" width="342" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note0" value="Setup before + turnaround after widen every&lt;br&gt;availability / conflict check (SG2-78);&lt;br&gt;existing pairs that now clash are flagged&lt;br&gt;as BookingClash (SG2-79)." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#B8A13A;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3093" y="719" width="265" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note1" value="SG2-81: new flag notifies Coordinator; Preparation/Confirmed&lt;br&gt;returns to Planning, clears confirmation and notifies Organiser.&lt;br&gt;Approval of a replacement atomically releases its old booking&lt;br&gt;and cancels its old request (202610170001). Other event details stay.&lt;br&gt;Pending replacement requests reserve nothing." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#B8A13A;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1993" y="966" width="410" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note2" value="W7 #3, built (SG2-83): the coordinator changes or cancels one&lt;br&gt;venue of a multi-venue event; the other bookings stay. A new venue&lt;br&gt;goes through the normal request and approval (15 Oct clarification)." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#B8A13A;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="507" y="424" width="405" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note3" value="15 Oct (SG2-106): a soft delete. Past bookings and history keep&lt;br&gt;the name; deleted venues leave search, availability, hold choices&lt;br&gt;and new requests." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;fillColor=#FFFBE6;strokeColor=#B8A13A;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" pa